<title>USA: NYSE says United Park declines comment.</title>
<headline>NYSE says United Park declines comment.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Monday it had contacted United Park City Mines Co about the company's unusual stock activity but the company did not wish to comment.</p>
<p>The NYSE said it requested the company to issue a statement indicating whether there were any corporate developments warranting the unusual activity.</p>
<p>The company stated it was not its policy to comment on such activity, NYSE said.</p>
<p>The company's stock closed up 2-1/8 to 13-3/4.</p>
